    "{s1}^^{s2}^^{s3}^^Maeron Vald stands before the gathered witnesses. 'You have victories. So does every brigand with enough horses. Where is your right?'^^Septima Varro's envoy waits with an Imperial answer. Vaska waits with a quieter one.",
